    <guid isPermaLink="false">63310bf9e67030aadb38e4ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Sep 2022 09:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题的灵感来源于B站上的一个小户型装修改造视频，链接为：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15P411H7Sp?is_story_h5=false&amp;p=1&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=9e3120a7-872b-4851-b355-b9871134276f&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i%C3%97tamp=1663643962&amp;unique_k=LgcXt0f" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15P411H7Sp?is_story_h5=false&amp;p=1&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=android&amp;share_plat=android&amp;share_session_id=9e3120a7-872b-4851-b355-b9871134276f&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i%C3%97tamp=1663643962&amp;unique_k=LgcXt0f"><span>www.bilibili.com×tamp=1663643962&amp;unique_k=LgcXt0f</span></a><span>，结合视频配套收听本期节目效果更佳。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小户型的装修原则建议如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 选择框架结构的建筑，利于后期改造</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 增加室内通透感，减少封闭/不透光结构</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.电器合理断舍离</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.充分运用上墙、悬挂、叠放等收纳技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.理性消费，减少杂物</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期剪辑：晴天</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：誓言–前奏笛音-窦唯</span></p>]]></description>
